* Lemma: instantiating the periodicity of X on the units mod D at two integers.

s1::id |- ( a = A -> a = A )
c1:s1:oveq1d |- ( a = A -> ( a gcd N ) = ( A gcd N ) )
c2:c1:eqeq1d |- ( a = A -> ( ( a gcd N ) = 1 <-> ( A gcd N ) = 1 ) )
